  "paper_id": "usenix-security-2026-sok-attack-and-defense-landscape-of-agentic-ai-systems-1fa097e6",
  "title": "SoK: Attack and Defense Landscape of Agentic AI Systems",
  "abstract": "AI agents that integrate large language models with non-AI tool components are rapidly emerging in real-world applications, offering unprecedented automation and flexibility. However, this flexibility introduces complex security challenges that differ from traditional software systems. In this paper, we present the first comprehensive systematization of knowledge on AI agent security, analyzing the design space, attack landscape, and defense mechanisms for secure AI agent systems. In addition, we identify open challenges for future research in this emerging domain. Our work provides the first systematic framework for understanding AI agent security risks and defense strategies, serving as a foundation for building secure agentic systems and advancing research in this critical area.",
